---
import ArcLayout from '../../layouts/ArcLayout.astro';
import { getCanonicalOrigin } from '../../lib/siteCanonical';

const origin = getCanonicalOrigin();
const pageTitle = 'About ARC | Ascent. Refuge. Collective.';
const pageDescription =
  'Why ARC exists: a faith-rooted creative home for the overlooked, rooted in Nigeria and Rwanda. An initiative of Siryus Creative Media Ltd.';

const team = [
  { name: 'Chidiebere Ekwedike', role: 'Founder & Executive Lead' },
  { name: 'Jesse Joseph Wakili (Jlinez)', role: 'Music & Artist Community Lead' },
  { name: 'Adediwura Adedigba', role: 'Brand Strategist, Operations & Merch Lead' },
  { name: 'Francis Iwejuo', role: 'Visual Content & Community Co-Lead' },
  { name: "Opeyemi Lawal (Abba's Scribe)", role: 'Marketing & Growth Lead' },
  { name: 'Christian Chiamaka Ayoola', role: 'Communications, Copy & Community Co-Lead' },
  { name: 'Michelle Lawal', role: 'Finance Lead' },
  { name: 'Esther Johnson', role: 'Experiences & Community Lead' },
] as const;
---

<ArcLayout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription} canonical={`${origin}/arc/about`}>
  <div class="blog-page">
    <section class="blog-bleed blog-hero blog-reveal" aria-labelledby="arc-about-hero-heading">
      <div class="blog-hero__photo-layer" aria-hidden="true">
        <img
          class="blog-hero__photo"
          src="/arc/hero-section.webp"
          alt=""
          width="1920"
          height="1080"
          loading="eager"
          decoding="async"
        />
        <div class="blog-hero__photo-scrim"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="blog-hero__glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="blog-inner blog-hero__shell">
        <div class="morph-hero-glass-panel blog-hero__glass" style="max-width: 50rem;">
          <div class="blog-hero__inner" style="padding: 2rem 1.75rem;">
            <span class="blog-hero__label">ARC</span>
            <h1 id="arc-about-hero-heading" class="blog-hero__title">Built for the overlooked. Rooted in faith.</h1>
            <p class="blog-hero__sub">The story behind Ascent. Refuge. Collective.</p>
            <p class="blog-hero__sub" style="margin-top: 0.75rem;">
              <a href="/arc" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: underline;">← Back to ARC</a>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="blog-bleed arc-list-bridge blog-reveal">
      <div class="blog-inner arc-bridge__inner">
        <p class="arc-bridge__tagline">A long-haul home for faith-rooted creatives. Local roots, global reach.</p>
        <div class="arc-bridge__actions">
          <a class="arc-bridge__pill" href="/arc/blog">Journal</a>
          <a class="arc-bridge__pill arc-bridge__pill--ghost" href="/arc/events">Events</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="blog-bleed blog-section blog-reveal" aria-labelledby="arc-about-manifesto-heading">
      <div class="blog-inner">
        <header class="arc-section-head">
          <h2 id="arc-about-manifesto-heading" class="blog-section__title">Why ARC exists.</h2>
          <div class="arc-section-head__rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        </header>
        <div class="project-body blog-post-body arc-about-prose">
          <p>
            The dominant story of the creative industry, especially in the African gospel and faith-based space, is one
            of brilliant talent dying in isolation. Artists with genuine vision and deep wells of creativity are overlooked
            by major labels, burnt out by platforms that demand output over formation, and disconnected from peers who
            could elevate their work.
          </p>
          <p>ARC was built to change that story.</p>
          <p>
            We say the overlooked are not failures. They are seeds waiting for the right ground. And ARC is that ground.
          </p>
          <p>
            The name is intentional. Ascent: the climb, skill sharpened by discipline, calling forged in process. Refuge:
            the sanctuary, a quiet room where honesty, rest, and craft can breathe. Collective: the tribe, builders
            moving together, carrying weight for each other.
          </p>
          <p>
            The ark metaphor runs deep. Just as Noah's ark was not built for the sea but to survive it, ARC is not built
            for the moment. It is built for the long haul. To carry the seeds of a new cultural movement safely through
            the noise of trends, commercial pressure, and spiritual compromise, until those seeds are ready to change the
            world.
          </p>
          <p>We are not in a hurry. Slow and steady. Constant growth without compromise.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="blog-bleed blog-section blog-reveal" aria-labelledby="arc-about-where-heading">
      <div class="blog-inner">
        <header class="arc-section-head">
          <h2 id="arc-about-where-heading" class="blog-section__title">Nigeria. Rwanda. The world.</h2>
          <p class="arc-section-head__lede">
            ARC was founded with a presence across Nigeria and Rwanda. Nigeria is home to a vibrant, battle-tested gospel
            creative scene. Rwanda and East Africa represent an open field: minimal visible afro-gospel infrastructure,
            maximum opportunity. ARC is planting roots in both. The work begins local and grows global.
          </p>
          <div class="arc-section-head__rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        </header>

        <div class="arc-about-location-grid">
          <article class="arc-about-loc-card blog-reveal">
            <p class="arc-about-loc-card__city">Lagos, Nigeria</p>
            <p class="arc-about-loc-card__note">
              Where the sound is sharpest and the creative hunger runs deep.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article class="arc-about-loc-card blog-reveal">
            <p class="arc-about-loc-card__city">Kigali, Rwanda</p>
            <p class="arc-about-loc-card__note">
              A new frontier for afro-gospel creativity. ARC is here early, on purpose.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="blog-bleed blog-section blog-section--tight-bottom blog-reveal" aria-labelledby="arc-about-team-heading">
      <div class="blog-inner">
        <header class="arc-section-head">
          <h2 id="arc-about-team-heading" class="blog-section__title">The people building it.</h2>
          <p class="arc-section-head__lede">
            ARC was built by people who believe in it enough to give it their best work.
          </p>
          <div class="arc-section-head__rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        </header>

        <div class="arc-about-team-grid" role="list">
          {
            team.map((member) => (
              <article class="arc-about-team-card blog-reveal" role="listitem">
                <div class="arc-about-team-card__body">
                  <h3 class="arc-about-team-card__name">{member.name}</h3>
                  <p class="arc-about-team-card__role">{member.role}</p>
                </div>
              </article>
            ))
          }
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="blog-bleed blog-section blog-reveal" aria-labelledby="arc-about-siryus-heading">
      <div class="blog-inner">
        <header class="arc-section-head">
          <h2 id="arc-about-siryus-heading" class="blog-section__title">An initiative of Siryus Creative Media Ltd.</h2>
          <div class="arc-section-head__rule" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        </header>
        <div class="project-body blog-post-body arc-about-prose arc-about-prose--tight">
          <p>
            ARC operates under Siryus Creative Media Ltd, officially incorporated in Nigeria. Siryus is the structural
            home: the legal and operational infrastructure that allows ARC to move with intention and accountability. ARC
            is the creative mission it carries.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="blog-bleed arc-about-cta blog-reveal" aria-labelledby="arc-about-cta-heading">
      <div class="blog-inner arc-about-cta__inner">
        <h2 id="arc-about-cta-heading" class="arc-about-cta__title">Want to be part of what we're building?</h2>
        <a class="arc-bridge__pill" href="/arc/community">Join the community</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</ArcLayout>

<script is:inline>
  (function () {
    var reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
    var els = document.querySelectorAll('.blog-reveal');
    if (reduce) {
      els.forEach(function (el) {
        el.classList.add('is-visible');
      });
      return;
    }
    var io = new IntersectionObserver(
      function (entries) {
        entries.forEach(function (e) {
          if (e.isIntersecting) {
            e.target.classList.add('is-visible');
            io.unobserve(e.target);
          }
        });
      },
      { threshold: 0.1, rootMargin: '0px 0px -24px 0px' }
    );
    els.forEach(function (el) {
      io.observe(el);
    });
  })();
</script>

<style>
  :global(.arc-about-prose p) {
    margin: 1.35rem 0;
    line-height: 1.72;
  }

  :global(.arc-about-prose--tight p) {
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.72;
  }

  .arc-about-location-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .arc-about-loc-card {
    margin: 0;
    padding: clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 1.65rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--arc-border);
    background: var(--arc-card);
    border-radius: 6px;
    box-shadow: 0 18px 44px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
  }

  :global(body.arc-route.light-theme) .arc-about-loc-card {
    box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(28, 18, 8, 0.06);
  }

  .arc-about-loc-card__city {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--arc-font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 2.4vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: var(--arc-fg);
  }

  .arc-about-loc-card__note {
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    font-family: var(--arc-font-body);
    font-size: clamp(0.98rem, 1vw + 0.9rem, 1.06rem);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--arc-muted);
  }

  .arc-about-team-grid {
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0.85rem 1rem;
  }

  .arc-about-team-card {
    margin: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--arc-border);
    background: var(--arc-card);
    border-radius: 6px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-height: 100%;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
  }

  .arc-about-team-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(242, 121, 48, 0.45);
    background: rgba(242, 121, 48, 0.04);
  }

  :global(body.arc-route.light-theme) .arc-about-team-card:hover {
    background: rgba(160, 82, 45, 0.06);
  }

  .arc-about-team-card__body {
    padding: 1.05rem 0.95rem 1.15rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .arc-about-team-card__name {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--arc-font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(1.22rem, 1.4vw, 1.45rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--arc-fg);
  }

  .arc-about-team-card__role {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--arc-font-body);
    font-size: clamp(0.86rem, 0.3vw + 0.82rem, 0.95rem);
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--arc-muted);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }

  .arc-about-cta {
    padding: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem) 0 clamp(3rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(242, 121, 48, 0.12) 0%, transparent 65%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 50% at 50% 100%, rgba(242, 121, 48, 0.08), transparent 55%);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--arc-border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--arc-border);
  }

  .arc-about-cta__inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: 1.35rem;
  }

  .arc-about-cta__title {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 36rem;
    font-family: var(--arc-font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
    line-height: 1.08;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--arc-fg);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1040px) {
    .arc-about-team-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .arc-about-location-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .arc-about-team-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }
  }
</style>
